.TH CHM-PERMS 1
.SH NAME
chm-perms \\- inspect and modify Chimera filesystem ownership and mode
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-perms
.RI { stat PATH | chmod MODE PATH | chown UID:GID PATH }
.SH DESCRIPTION
Provides a native administrative interface for Unix-style filesystem ownership and mode permissions. Root privileges are required for modifications.
